sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Chat interface
    participant SSE as Event stream
    participant API as Backend
    U->>UI: press enter
    UI->>UI: render the message optimistically
    UI->>API: open a streaming connection
    API-->>SSE: token events
    loop as they arrive
        SSE-->>UI: append to the message in place
        UI->>UI: keep the scroll pinned unless the user scrolled up
    end
    alt user hits stop
        UI->>API: abort
        API->>API: cancel generation and stop billing
    end
    alt connection drops
        UI->>API: reconnect, resume from the last stored offset
        Note over UI,API: the partial turn was persisted, so nothing regenerates
    end
